Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:11.09,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"EPISODE 5: BAWA AKU PERGI"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak sesuai dengan seleramu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma tak biasa pakai baju seperti ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asal tahu saja, setelan itu\Nberasal dari merek top Italia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan harganya 700.000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong pakai dengan hati-hati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seperti yang kubilang kemarin,\Nyang akan makan bersama kalian hari ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako harus hadir di makan siang\Nbisnis bersama Tuan Kagen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan aku akan menemaninya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune bilang padaku, ini kesempatan\Nuntuk belajar tentang kalangan atas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona, Anda pernah ikut\Npertemuan sosial untuk klien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}waktu umur tujuh tahun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan Anda memperkenalkan diri\Npada direkturnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pastikan Anda bersikap sopan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Merepotkan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak ada yang mau mengalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Restoran bergaya pedesaan di dekat sini\Nyang ukurannya lebih kecil...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah itu yang kau bilang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan ke lobi, Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tempat duduknya di teras terbuka,\Njadi kami akan menunggumu di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan bertemu para lelaki tua\Nyang tak kukenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cara bicaramu itu tak sopan, jadi hentikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.47,0:01:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada lagi yang mau dibilang?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan berusaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.67,0:01:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski dari jauh, aku akan mengawasimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita bisa bersantai\Nsetelah kembali ke rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau es krim lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Itsuki, kenapa ada es krim di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar Hinako!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rich Girl Caretaker:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I'm Secretly the Caregiver of the\NMost Popular Girl in This Rich Kid School
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih sudah datang ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang mengusulkan ide makan\Ndi kelilingi alam begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Hinako, ya?\NSenang bertemu denganmu lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita pernah bertemu sekali dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kita bertemu di festival bunga.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah membawaku ke sana\Nsaat umurku tujuh tahun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, aku senang sekali kau mengingatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tumbuh jadi gadis yang cantik.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya kenalan\Nyang anaknya bersekolah di Akademi Kiou,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kudengar mereka menjulukimu\Nnona muda yang sempurna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda terlalu memuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari kita duduk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Itsuki, bagaimana pendapatmu\Ntentang pertemuan bisnis ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eum, bagaimana bilangnya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang terlihat santai soal etika.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sendiri sudah bagian dari etika.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bersikap wajar, tak terlalu kaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi tetap menjaga wibawa\Nuntuk menunjukkan rasa hormat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang mematuhinya,\Nsehingga terbangun rasa saling percaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.74,0:04:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saling percaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang ini masyarakat\Ncenderung mengabaikan etika,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi ada kalanya itu diperlukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terutama bagi mereka yang tak bisa\Nbicara blak-blakan, seperti para petinggi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Etika adalah cara meraih kepercayaan\Nlewat sikap, bukan ucapan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itulah\Nmelanggar etika itu sangat tidak sopan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.39,0:04:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putrimu memang sehebat yang kudengar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sikapnya sangat anggun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yakin\Npasti banyak yang mengantre ingin melamarnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayangnya, belum ada lamaran semacam itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, benarkah begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya, ada kenalanku\Nyang sedang mencari pendamping hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh ceritakan lebih detail?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang sedang mereka bicarakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang salah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, tidak ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma perasaanku saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako tiba-tiba melamun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia mengelola bisnis perdagangan\Nyang target pasarnya selebritas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kupertimbangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya dia kurang tertarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, akan kupertimbangkan\Ndengan sungguh-sungguh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pencuci mulutnya datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, sepertinya itu kue panggang?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, aku jadi tak sabar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah kalau Anda suka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak apa-apa kalau aku sampaikan padanya
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bahwa kau tertarik\Ndengan perjodohan ini, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanpa bermaksud menyombong,\Naku jamin putriku itu bibit unggul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako, kau dengar itu semua?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aturan belum tiga detik.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata reputasinya\Ntidak sesuai dengan kenyataan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang akan terjadi padanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak tahu pasti,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi mengingat sifat Tuan Kagen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ini situasi yang sangat buruk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak\Natas kehadiran Anda hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, aku sangat menikmatinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesekali bersantai begini\Nmemang menyenangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu hal lagi, Tuan Konohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong lupakan pembicaraan perjodohan tadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nama baikku akan tercoreng\Njika aku yang mengusulkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa yang mengajari Hinako\Nperilaku tak sopan begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:06:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, itu aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak awal aku sudah meragu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.87,0:07:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kita benar-benar butuh seorang pengurus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seharusnya aku tidak menoleransi\Nkesalahannya sedikit pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini semua terjadi karena dia dibiarkan\Nbertindak semaunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai sekarang, pastikan Hinako menjaga sikap\Ndi mana pun dia berada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika disuruh begitu,\NNona akan langsung jatuh sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sembuhkan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku terlalu lunak karena dia sakit,\Ndan inilah hasilnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, dia tak punya penyakit parah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cari cara agar dia bisa bertahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia lahir di Keluarga Konohana,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi menjaga nama keluarga adalah tugasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.53,0:07:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sama saja dengan merenggut\Njati diri Hinako...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf sudah mengacaukan jamuannya,\Ndan ini murni kesalahanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tetap saja, terlalu kejam jika...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan salahmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.25,0:07:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua pengurus kami berhenti\Ndalam waktu singkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.55,0:08:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupikir kau juga akan\Nmelakukan hal yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.87,0:08:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupikir pengaruhmu pada Hinako\Ntakkan seberapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan salahmu,\Ntapi salahku yang salah menilai,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan juga Hinako\Nyang terlalu mudah terpengaruh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune, siapkan gaji Tuan Itsuki\Nsesampainya kita di rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gajiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako tak butuh pengurus lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini adalah hari terakhirmu\Nbekerja bersama kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tak mungkin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku beri sedikit bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika tak punya tempat tinggal,\Ngunakan uang itu untuk biaya hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemas barang-barangmu sekarang juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami akan mengurus surat pindah sekolahmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya sirna hanya dalam hitungan jam...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seluruh rutinitas sehari-hariku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, sejak awal\Nsemua ini memang terasa seperti mimpi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seandainya ini semua\Nbenar-benar hanya mimpi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begitu, Hinako tak perlu menderita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona, bagaimana keadaan Anda?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana dengan Itsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Itsuki sudah pergi dari sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki jadi pengurusku\Nselama sebulan penuh, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bertahan cukup lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dia tak bisa jadi pengurusku,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tak bisakah kita mempekerjakannya\Nsebagai pelayan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar kita sedang butuh tukang kebun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.31,0:10:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau koki?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau petugas kebersihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak posisi yang kosong, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.53,0:10:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Kagen tak berniat mempertahankan\NTuan Itsuki untuk tetap bekerja di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin bertemu Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebaiknya jangan memancing\Nkemarahan Tuan Kagen lebih jauh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ada di pihak siapa, Shizune?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Kagen yang menggajiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.51,0:10:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah kalau begitu.\NBiar aku yang mencarinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.25,0:10:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus kembali bekerja,\Njadi aku permisi dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagai langkah berjaga-jaga,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku akan meminta seseorang berjaga\Ndi depan kamar Anda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.35,0:10:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong jangan bertindak gegabah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kirim orang ke rumah utama sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.12,0:11:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune tak paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku justru makin gigih saat ditekan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata benar itu kau, Itsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedang apa kau di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa? Aku cuma lagi jalan-jalan\Nsambil berbelanja.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah bebas keluar rumah sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah aku menang melawan ayahku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.13,0:11:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kendo, judo, aikido...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengalahkannya\Ndi semua cabang bela diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah syarat\Nagar aku boleh keluar rumah sesukaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau hebat sekali, Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Itsuki?\NApa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, jadi begitu ceritanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, bagaimana nasib Konohana sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak diizinkan menemuinya\Nsebelum aku pergi dari rumah itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sepertinya, penjagaan mereka\Nakan jauh lebih ketat dari sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:12:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia mungkin takkan bisa ikut\Npesta teh atau kelompok belajar lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarga Konohana kejam sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua ini cuma gara-gara satu kesalahan...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini semua salahku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seandainya aku tak mengajarinya hal konyol,\Nini takkan pernah terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rakyat biasa sepertiku yang tak tahu\Ntata krama
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.87,0:12:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seharusnya tak pernah\Ndekat-dekat dengan Hinako!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau salah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau salah, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih ingat bagaimana aku dulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa berdiri di sini\Nhanya karena kau telah mengubah duniaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih mengingat hari itu dengan jelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betapa enaknya jajanan itu,\Ndan pengalaman membelinya,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}keramaian jalan, tenangnya taman...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika tak ada kau,\Naku takkan pernah tahu itu semua.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga takkan pernah kepikiran\Nuntuk melawan ayahku
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan merebut kebebasanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah aku sudah pernah bilang\Nbetapa bersyukurnya aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:13:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat berterima kasih\Nsampai tak bisa diungkapkan dengan kata-kata.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Konohana pasti merasakan hal yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau juga yang mengenalkan dunia luar\Npada Konohana, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau harus lebih percaya diri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah sisi darimu, yang aku su-su...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya-Yang kuanggap luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal-hal yang kuanggap sepele\Ndan biasa saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata sangat berharga\Nbagi Narika maupun Hinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus segera pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke rumah Konohana\Nuntuk bicara langsung pada mereka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, aku malah membantu sainganku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memanggilnya Hinako...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya sedekat apa hubungan mereka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah aku sudah berjanji padanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk selalu ada di sisinya\Ndan mendukungnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat keluarga dan teman sekelasnya\Ntak bisa diandalkan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, aku akan jadi pengurusnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau kembali?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong biarkan aku masuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tahu kami tak bisa mengizinkanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau butuh izin untuk masuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tubuhku refleks bergerak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei! Jangan melawan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku sedang buru-buru!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyusup! Tangkap dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial, ke mana dia pergi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.97,0:14:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti dia masih ada di luar gedung!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang bagaimana caranya aku masuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Hinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tak ada di depan pintu utama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di lobi utama juga tak ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana dengan sayap utara?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia mungkin lewat pintu khusus pelayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketemu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menyerahlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan biarkan kalian menangkapku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Lapor, Pusat Komando!\N- Tubuhku masih ingat hasil latihan itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Shizune!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kantornya pasti ada di lantai paling atas...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang kau lakukan, Hinako?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:15:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak sanggup lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:15:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tangkap aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tangkapan yang bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ngapain kau?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin bertemu denganmu, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya ide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia menculik Nona!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, sial!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.01,0:16:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku diculik lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak kusangka aku bakal jadi penculik.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita berhasil kabur dari mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, apa idemu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan jadi sanderamu, jadi bujuklah Ayah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.95,0:16:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu lebih mirip ancaman ketimbang bujukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, ancam saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, itu takkan\Nmenyelesaikan masalah utamanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus membujuk Tuan Kagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya dia mau dibujuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kulakukan. Percayalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda mau membawa Nona ke mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku lupa bilang,\Nkau lumayan berbakat bela diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau berkembang pesat\Ndalam waktu yang singkat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daripada memujiku, mending minggir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa melakukan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.55,0:17:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon, biarkan aku tetap bersama Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan terus berakting\Ndengan sempurna mulai sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan pernah melepas topengku lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.66,0:17:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan berakting sempurna\Ndi mana pun dan kapan pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako, jangan begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak mau kau memaksakan diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku ingin ada di sisimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin jadi satu-satunya orang
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.99,0:17:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang di depannya kau\Ntak perlu memakai topeng.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kumohon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:18:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan buang\Napa yang sedang berusaha kulindungi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Aku mengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}memercayaimu, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf mengganggu momen mesra kalian...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak perlu cemas,\Nkarena yang kau takutkan itu takkan terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon tunggu sebentar lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tepat pada waktunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku segera ke sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.47,0:18:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Kagen memanggilku, jadi aku pamit dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berdua, tunggu di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune, kau ini ada di pihak siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Kagen yang menggajiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku akan selalu berpihak pada Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune, apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Balasan atas undangan pesta\Ndi kediaman Konohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:19:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena Tuan tinggal di rumah ini\Nuntuk sementara,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku meminta surat yang dikirim\Nke rumah utama diteruskan ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, aku paham soal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang ingin kutanyakan adalah\Nsoal keempat tamu undangan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Karen Asahi\Nadalah putri pemilik Jays Holdings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagai perusahaan ritel elektronik...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak perlu menjelaskan\Nlatar belakang keempat bisnis ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski aku tak mengundang Keluarga Asahi\Nmaupun Keluarga Taisho,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.38,0:19:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mereka adalah mitra bisnis yang penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan mengenai Keluarga Miyakojima\Nyang cuma kukenal sepintas,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku baru saja ditelepon\Nbahwa kepala keluarganya
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dengan senang hati akan hadir\Njika putrinya datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, putri Tennoji\Njuga bakal hadir...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hubungan kita dengan kompetitor\Nselalu jadi soal pelik.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ini kesempatan langka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk menumbuhkan kepercayaan\Ndengan Grup Tennoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masalahnya, bagaimana ceritanya\Nkita bisa mengundang mereka berempat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka kebetulan adalah teman sekolah Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi maksudmu, Hinako yang mengundang mereka?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal dia belum pernah\Nmengundang siapa pun,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.99,0:20:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan tiba-tiba membawa relasi sekuat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.81,0:20:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika boleh berpendapat...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.07,0:20:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika Tuan merasa\NNona telah berubah jadi lebih baik,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.06,0:20:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku rasa kurang bijak memecat orang
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.31,0:20:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang berjasa mewujudkan perubahan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.81,0:20:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang yang berjasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mitra bisnis atau bukan,\Njika aku disuruh memilih
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}antara galangan kapal\Nyang koneksinya sedikit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}atau empat perusahaan raksasa\Nyang bisa jadi mitra krusial...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah jelas mana yang jadi prioritas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bawa Itsuki kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku benar-benar merasa salah tempat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Tomonari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, jasmu bagus juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itsuki! Tolong aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak betah dengan suasana mewah ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau panik cuma karena soal sepele.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kita sapa tamu lainnya\Nbareng-bareng?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa aku mau minum dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian semua tampak menawan\Nmemakai jas dan gaun begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.27,0:21:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak atas kemurahan hati\Nyang Anda tunjukkan kepadaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako itu genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nilainya paling bagus seakademi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.03,0:21:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan itu maksudku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kepribadiannya mungkin agak bermasalah,\Ntapi bakat bisnisnya luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin tak terlihat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi bakat kepemimpinan Keluarga Konohana\Nmengalir dalam darahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mata publik, seolah aku ingin cari\Nmenantu yang kelak mewarisi bisnisku,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}padahal sesungguhnya aku ingin\NHinako-lah yang meneruskan bisnisku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin sekarang ini jadi beban untuknya,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi bakatnya akan mekar suatu hari nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.59,0:21:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih tak paham\Njalan pikiran Tuan Kagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.09,0:21:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nasib Keluarga Konohana ke depannya\Nbukan urusanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang jelas, aku adalah pengurus Hinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah bilang kau di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.21,0:22:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.62,0:22:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih\Nsudah mau terus jadi pengurusku.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat senang\Ndengan apa yang kau bilang waktu itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.36,0:22:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan terus memercayaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.91,0:22:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kadang aku merasa\Nakan lalai pada tugasku.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.82,0:22:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku lelah menyapa tamu seharian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tepuk kepalaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}H-Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.75,0:22:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa? Wajahmu memerah tiba-tiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:22:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:22:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kurang enak badan,\Nsebaiknya istirahat saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}T-Tidak apa-apa kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.01,0:23:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aneh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.93,0:23:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa aku merasa aneh begini?
